@startuml 11_Collaboration_Diagram_Student
' Engineering College - Collaboration Diagram for STUDENT Module
' A4 Page Layout

title Engineering College - STUDENT Module Collaboration Diagram

actor Student
boundary StudentLoginView
boundary StudentDashboardView
control StudentProfileController
control CertificateController
control ResearchController
entity Student
entity StudentForm
entity Certificate
entity ResearchPublication
entity Syllabus
entity Gallery

Student -> StudentLoginView: login(ht_no)
StudentLoginView -> StudentDashboardView: authenticate()
Student -> StudentProfileController: updateProfile()
StudentProfileController -> Student: save()
StudentProfileController -> StudentForm: validate()
Student -> CertificateController: uploadCertificates()
CertificateController -> Certificate: save()
Student -> ResearchController: manageResearch()
ResearchController -> ResearchPublication: CRUD()
Student -> Syllabus: viewSyllabus()
Student -> Gallery: viewGallery()

@enduml